      <shape width="817.58" height="32" topLeftX="62.42" topLeftY="372" type="text">
        <content verticalAlign="middle" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="12" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体">本页判断：次数已知的重复用 for；初始化只做一次，判断、循环体、更新一轮一轮转。</span></p>
        </content>
